.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "25 September 2026" "libmyutils v1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <mystrfunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mystrcat ()
function appends the
.I src
string to the
.I dest
string, overwriting the terminating null byte at the end of dest, and appends a null byte.
.SH AUTHOR
Annas Sharif (BSDSF24A008)
